  'draft', 'foundation',
  'A 32-year-old builder presents to the emergency department immediately after a bag of wet cement splashed into his right eye. He is in severe pain with photophobia and blepharospasm, and describes the vision in that eye as very blurred. His colleague brought him straight to hospital, and he arrived within ten minutes of the injury.',
  'What is the most appropriate immediate first step in management?',
  array['chemical eye injury','alkali burn','ocular emergency']
),
