  'draft', 'core',
  'A 22-year-old man presents after being punched in the right eye during an altercation two hours ago. He complains of double vision, particularly on looking upwards, and numbness over his right cheek and upper lip. On examination there is bruising and swelling around the eye, restricted upward gaze of the right eye, and the right eye appears slightly sunken compared with the left.',
  'What is the most appropriate initial investigation?',
  array['orbital blow-out fracture','diplopia','facial trauma']
