  'draft', 'core',
  'A 19-year-old man presents after being struck in the right eye by a squash ball during a game thirty minutes ago. He complains of blurred vision and mild pain. On examination there is a visible layer of blood filling the lower part of the anterior chamber of the right eye, and visual acuity is reduced to 6/18.',
